Tasks:
- [x] Inspect the reference and establish download/license availability.
- [x] Replace the oval shell with stepped shoulders, straight sides and lower bow.
- [x] Reduce bezel/button proportions and move L/R to the shoulder edges.
- [x] Add real speaker apertures, rounded button caps and a recessed D-pad center.
- [x] Correct dependent framing, LCD occlusion and undersized switch details.
- [x] Review actual table/front/back renders and verify physical controls.
