Acceptance criteria:
- Independently authored 3D geometry, not an extracted Sketchfab asset.
- Stepped upper crown and shoulders, straighter sides and outward lower bow.
- Lower-profile controls, angled recessed grille and unobstructed actual LCD.
- Pickup/rotation/return and all ten physical inputs remain functional.
- No copyrighted reference thumbnail, logo texture or boot image shipped.
- Test evidence does not establish user approval or permission to publish.

Completion evidence:
- 2026-11-04: Public Sketchfab model a0b6d1eb5ccb4c72a6944d77b3ac7c05,
  by Andy Dream, reported isDownloadable:false and an empty license object.
- Original procedural geometry revised; no model/texture extraction performed.
- Table/front/back screenshots inspected against the public reference thumbnail.
- Actual raycast surfaces verify an unobstructed LCD, recessed speaker openings
  and shallow D-pad pivot well; responsive mesh bounds remain within view.
- Syntax check PASS; unit suite 9/9 PASS; build PASS.
- Final complete Edge browser suite 13/13 PASS, using original Pixel Lab only.
- An earlier full run and its isolated replay failed native PNG equality on
  reload. A direct native-pixel probe, three subsequent isolated cases and the
  final complete suite passed. Root cause remains unresolved; no save fix claimed.
- Local dist preview rebuilt; no new commit, push or Pages deployment.

Completion log:
- 2026-11-04: User explicitly rejected the first 3D model and allowed shape
  inspiration if the supplied model could not be used directly.
- 2026-11-04: Reference inspection identified the oval shell, oversized raised
  controls and raised grille as inaccurate. Rebuilt those features and adjusted
  camera fit for the taller crown/bottom.
- 2026-11-04: Depth review found the beveled LCD recess could cover its display;
  reduced its bevel. Raised the pivot well floor above the underlying socket,
  reduced switch grip size and made the upper oval marking horizontal.
- 2026-11-04: Geometry/input/native-CRT tests pass. Kept the intermittent reload
  assertion caveat rather than inventing a cause or modifying save behavior.
  Updated public-safe renders and continuity; new visual acceptance is pending.
